{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他此刻生出一种踏实的骄傲，觉得自己有能力把意愿付诸行动。先前那股没方向的行动渴望，让这份能力感格外珍贵。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始相信，自己的意愿即使尚无明确目标，也能成为行动的起点。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"前文的渴望本就指向行动，只是缺少目标，因此把本段理解为对自身行动能力的确认，衔接自然。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选6\",\n        \"候选12\",\n        \"候选13\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他此刻显得克制而紧绷，连那份骄傲都像需要费力撑住。先前那股没方向的行动渴望，让他格外在意内心能否保持稳定。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始格外看重内心的稳定，尤其在行动方向不明时。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"前文的不甘和无方向的行动欲，为他转而重视内心稳定提供了动因，但把骄傲理解为费力维持的状态，仍多了一层心理推断。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选1\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b1ce33b-a2c6-449f-be5a-a94ebc2d45ff", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T032947182234Z", "elapsed_seconds": 122.016, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T03:31:49.218214+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5886dff2e8387e0ad53eab7b47eca4bc42c94750c7f8d82e849e969e1f07cb05", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "